      "subject": "עד כה ועד כה",
      "rationale": "Kĩugo kĩa Kĩhibirania 'kinya ũguo na kinya ũguo' kĩmanĩte na 'thutha wa ithaa nini' — kĩugo kĩa gũkinyĩria kĩrĩa kĩiega gĩtiganĩrwo."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "התקדרו",
      "rationale": "Kĩuga gĩa Kĩhibirania kĩugaga 'gũtuĩka mũcai wa mũrĩrĩ' (ashy-dark); 'gĩtheru-inĩ kĩa gĩtheru' nĩ kĩugo gĩa kũonekanya tu."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "גשם גדול",
      "rationale": "Kĩugwo 'kũnina kũnene' handũ ha 'mũthenya mũnini wa kũnina' — גשם nĩ kũnina kwa ithaa ĩmwe, ti kĩndũ kĩnene."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Nĩgo thutha wa ithaa nini, na igũrũ nĩciatuĩkirie gĩtheru-inĩ kĩa maciangi na ruaki, nĩokire kũnina kũnene. Ahabi akinyita gĩthurũma na agĩthiĩ Yizireeri.",
